      "bookmarkId": "750578_31_4229-4259",
      "chapterUid": 31,
      "range": "4229-4259",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你需要的只有自己的身体、正确的知识，还有斩钉截铁的态度而已。",
      "totalCount": 1476
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 417702302,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_29_1035-1068",
      "chapterUid": 29,
      "range": "1035-1068",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果他连自己的身体都无法运用自如，那他又怎么配得上“强壮”二字呢？",
      "totalCount": 1442
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
