      "bookmarkId": "750578_34_2559-2611",
      "chapterUid": 34,
      "range": "2559-2611",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "最主要的俯卧撑练习还是应该做得慢一些，经2秒降到最低点，坚持1秒，再用2秒回到最高点，之后立即降低身体。",
      "totalCount": 1378
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 62602309,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_29_4493-4554",
      "chapterUid": 29,
      "range": "4493-4554",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我向我能找到的每一个人学习，在我的狱友中有体操运动员、军人、举重运动员、习武者、瑜伽练习者、摔跤运动员，甚至还有几位医生。",
      "totalCount": 1372
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 330083544,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_32_7248-7281",
      "chapterUid": 32,
      "range": "7248-7281",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "灯熄了。你独处在你的囚室之中，一无所有，只有自己的身体与心灵相伴。",
      "totalCount": 1242
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 13873574,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_29_7089-7105",
      "chapterUid": 29,
      "range": "7089-7105",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "锻炼就是一种信仰，一种生活方式。",
      "totalCount": 1232
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 3035491,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_27_611-644",
      "chapterUid": 27,
      "range": "611-644",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你被绑着关在囚室中，但此时你仍然享有精神自由，谁也无法将其夺走。”",
      "totalCount": 1170
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 51165037,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_29_5951-6011",
      "chapterUid": 29,
      "range": "5951-6011",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "1928年，他仅仅通过拉住了拴在飞机上的一根绳子，就成功地阻止了飞机起飞（他甚至都犯不上用手，只是把绳子系在了头发上）。",
      "totalCount": 1152
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 228921656,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_32_6576-6606",
      "chapterUid": 32,
      "range": "6576-6606",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我在狱中学来，在此将其与你分享，这样你就不必再去狱中学习了。",
      "totalCount": 1071
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
