      "range": "7016-7036",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你的终极目标必须是完美地做到六个最终式。",
      "totalCount": 900
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 69298526,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_26_1015-1041",
      "chapterUid": 26,
      "range": "1015-1041",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "很幸运，我在近20年的服刑期间学到了这一传统的方法。",
      "totalCount": 828
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 278216283,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_35_10875-10902",
      "chapterUid": 35,
      "range": "10875-10902",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "对任何开始练习深蹲的人来说，肩倒立深蹲都是完美的起点。",
      "totalCount": 812
    },
    {
      "bookId": "750578",
      "userVid": 319016283,
      "bookmarkId": "750578_26_1425-1443",
      "chapterUid": 26,
      "range": "1425-1443",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我保证：以本书为师，你将与强壮相伴！",
      "totalCount": 804
    },
    {
